  "worked_solution": "We will use the following formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)^{2}={a}^{2}+2ab+{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a={x}^{4}$ and $b=2{c}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({x}^{4}+2{c}^{2})^{2} & = \\\\ {({x}^{4})}^{2}+2({x}^{4})(2{c}^{2})+(2{c}^{2})^{2} & = \\\\ {x}^{8}+4{x}^{4}{c}^{2}+4{c}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
